    pronouns: 'he/him',
    languages: ['English', 'Mandarin', 'Japanese'],
    location: 'Singapore',
    bio: 'A former competitive quiz champion with victories in national trivia tournaments across three continents, Marcus brings unparalleled expertise in content curation. His meticulous attention to detail and vast knowledge base ensure every fact is verified and every question is perfectly balanced for difficulty and engagement.',
    longBio: 'Marcus Chen\'s love for trivia began at age 8 when he won his first school quiz competition. By 25, he had claimed championship titles at the Asian Trivia Masters, Singapore Quiz Bowl, and the International Knowledge Olympics.\n\nHis competitive background gives him unique insight into what makes a great quiz question. Marcus understands the perfect balance between challenge and fairness, ensuring players feel rewarded for their knowledge while still learning something new.\n\nAt LogicLeague, Marcus oversees all content quality and fact-checking. Every quiz passes through his rigorous verification process, where claims are cross-referenced with multiple authoritative sources. His multilingual abilities allow him to source fascinating trivia from cultures around the world, making our quizzes truly global in scope.\n\nMarcus holds records for the fastest completion times on several LogicLeague quizzes and occasionally hides easter eggs in his questions for eagle-eyed players to discover.',
    expertise: ['Trivia Curation', 'Difficulty Balancing', 'Competitive Gaming', 'Fact-Checking', 'Cross-Cultural Content'],
