    location: 'Berlin, Germany',
    bio: 'Sofia\'s background in gamification and user experience design has revolutionized how players interact with LogicLeague. With expertise spanning four languages and cultures, she crafts experiences that resonate globally. Her community-first approach has built a thriving ecosystem of over 2 million active players who return daily.',
    longBio: 'Sofia Kowalski is the heart and soul of LogicLeague\'s community. With a Master\'s degree in Human-Computer Interaction from TU Berlin and 8 years in UX design, she brings both scientific rigor and creative flair to every player interaction.\n\nBefore LogicLeague, Sofia led gamification initiatives at a major social platform, where she increased daily active users by 250% through innovative engagement mechanics. Her expertise in behavioral psychology helps design reward systems that feel genuinely satisfying without being manipulative.\n\nSofia pioneered LogicLeague\'s daily challenge system, streak rewards, and achievement badges—features that players cite as their favorite aspects of the platform. She personally reads hundreds of player comments each week, ensuring the community\'s voice shapes product decisions.\n\nFluent in four languages, Sofia oversees localization efforts and ensures cultural sensitivity across all content. She hosts monthly community events and has built a global network of quiz enthusiasts who create user-generated content for the platform.',
    expertise: ['Gamification', 'UX Design', 'Community Building', 'Behavioral Psychology', 'Localization'],
    achievements: [
      {
